, communicate with users, and support operational requirements.'],['Partners','Trusted service providers may process information only as needed to support Money Mails services and must preserve confidentiality.']],About:[['About Money Mails','Money Mails connects users with local stores, deals, and paid mail opportunities. Users can discover nearby brands, receive promotional mail, and earn points through eligible paid mail interactions.'],['Local Deals','The app focuses on location-aware offers from essentials such as grocery stores, salons, restaurants, and other local businesses.'],['Rewards','Eligible paid mail activity can earn points, which may be redeemed according to Money Mails reward rules and account status.']],FAQ:[['What is Money Mails?','Money Mails is a local deals and rewards app that helps users discover brands, offers, and paid mail.'],['Why complete my profile?','Profile details help Money Mails verify your account and tailor deals to your current location.'],['Can I change my ZIP?','Current ZIP changes require Money Mails Support because location-based eligibility depends on verified address data.'],['How do rewards work?','Eligible paid mail and reward activity can generate points. Redemption is subject to account and admin verification.']],Support:[['Support','For account, ZIP, verification, reward, or offer issues, contact Money Mails Support through the official support channel.'],['Before Contacting Support','Include your registered email, phone number if available, and a clear description of the issue so support can locate your account quickly.']]},p=function(e){var t,o=e.route,i=(null==o||null==(t=o.params)?void 0:t.page)||'Terms',s=u[i]||u.Terms;return(0,l.jsxs)(r.ScrollView,{style:y.page,contentContainerStyle:y.content,children:[(0,l.jsx)(r.Text,{style:y.title,children:i}),s.map(function(e){var t=(0,n.default)(e,2),o=t[0],i=t[1];return(0,l.jsxs)(r.View,{style:y.section,children:[(0,l.jsx)(r.Text,{style:y.heading,children:o}),(0,l.jsx)(r.